<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>This local learning application stores accounts, carts, orders, and activity in memory. They are lost on restart.
    Uploaded product pictures remain on disk.</p>
    <p>Use fictitious names and contact details. Sellers see contact details for their paid orders. Admins can review
        business records but cannot see passwords or card details. Authentication uses an HTTP-only cookie and password
        hashes.</p>
        <p>When Stripe test mode is enabled, checkout takes place on Stripe's hosted page. Never enter real card information
into this demo.</p>